{
  "title": "Signal Fish Client",
  "description": "Multiplayer sessions for Godot 4, in pure GDScript.\n\nRooms with join codes, typed methods and signals, reconnection with missed-event replay, MessagePack and binary game data, and an optional WebRTC mesh. No threads, no blocking calls, nothing to compile - works in web exports.\n\nSelf-host the open-source MIT server, or use the hosted service: https://signalfish.network",
